# The autonomy loop rewrites its run-state log every session. Merging `main`
# into a long-lived autonomy branch repeatedly conflicted on this one file and
# forced manual resolutions. Keep the branch's own (newest) state on merge.
# Requires a one-time `git config merge.ours.driver true` (see AGENTS.md).
.agents_tmp/RUN_STATE.json merge=ours
